                "collapsible_hb3dWF": {
                  "type": "collapsible",
                  "name": "Collapsible",
                  "settings": {
                    "label": "What's the difference between WLP-1 and Berberine?",
                    "metafield_namespace_key": "product.smart.faqs",
                    "metafield_image_key": "image",
                    "metafield_label_key": "question",
                    "accordion_class": "accordion",
                    "content": "<p>WLP-1 targets the GLP-1 pathway, the same fullness hormone GLP-1 injections work on. It helps quiet cravings and supports calorie burn at rest. Berberine works on blood sugar and insulin sensitivity, which steadies energy and reduces sugar cravings. They complement each other, which is why we bundle them in the Ultimate Stack.</p>",
                    "show": false,
                    "metafield_content_key": "answer",
                    "metafield_default_state": "open_first",
                    "auto_close_siblings": true,
                    "dynamic_content_type": "default",
                    "custom_css": "& {\n}",
                    "hide_if_empty": "none"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "collapsible_VGytyG": {
                  "type": "collapsible",
                  "name": "Collapsible",
                  "settings": {
                    "label": "Can I take these if I'm already on a GLP-1 medication?",
                    "metafield_namespace_key": "product.smart.faqs",
                    "metafield_image_key": "image",
                    "metafield_label_key": "question",
                    "accordion_class": "accordion",
                    "content": "<p>Always check with your prescribing doctor first. Berberine is generally well tolerated alongside GLP-1 injections and can support blood sugar in parallel. WLP-1 targets the same pathway as your medication, so most prescribers prefer you use one approach at a time. Magnesium Glycinate is typically safe to add for sleep and stress support.</p>",
                    "show": false,
                    "metafield_content_key": "answer",
                    "metafield_default_state": "open_first",
                    "auto_close_siblings": true,
                    "dynamic_content_type": "default",
                    "custom_css": "& {\n}",
                    "hide_if_empty": "none"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "collapsible_93eet4": {
                  "type": "collapsible",
                  "name": "Collapsible",
                  "settings": {
                    "label": "How long before I see results?",
                    "metafield_namespace_key": "product.smart.faqs",
                    "metafield_image_key": "image",
                    "metafield_label_key": "question",
                    "accordion_class": "accordion",
                    "content": "<p>Most customers report appetite and craving changes within the first 2 to 3 weeks. Energy and digestion shifts often show up sooner. For body-composition changes, give it a full 60 to 90 days of consistent daily use paired with a moderate-protein, whole-food approach.</p>",
                    "show": false,
                    "metafield_content_key": "answer",
                    "metafield_default_state": "open_first",
                    "auto_close_siblings": true,
                    "dynamic_content_type": "default",
                    "custom_css": "& {\n}",
                    "hide_if_empty": "none"
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                },
                "collapsible_HqXtyU": {
                  "type": "collapsible",
                  "name": "Collapsible",
                  "settings": {
                    "label": "What makes your absorption better than standard supplements?",
                    "metafield_namespace_key": "product.smart.faqs",
                    "metafield_image_key": "image",
                    "metafield_label_key": "question",
                    "accordion_class": "accordion",
                    "content": "<p>Most supplement ingredients are fat-soluble and pass right through you in a standard capsule. Our Capsoil liposomal delivery wraps ingredients in a lipid layer your body actually absorbs. WLP-1 uses our Body Ready Tripeptide complex for up to 20x bioavailability vs standard capsules. Berberine uses the same liposomal approach for 6.2x absorption.</p>",
                    "show": false,
                    "metafield_content_key": "answer",
                    "metafield_default_state": "open_first",
                    "auto_close_siblings": true,
                    "dynamic_content_type": "default",
                    "custom_css": "& {\n}",
